# FOLIAGE-PROOF (Bistro half): ivy and shrubs on the Bistro street under the bistro-sun content (100 000 lux, EV100 14-15):
# not black, two-sided leaves, specular occlusion keeps leaves in the shade from glinting. Code is not changed.
Проект ../BistroFoliageProj/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/B16_Bistro_Street.desce
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -440,300,-230
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.6,0.05,-0.8
Тогда-вид 4_bistro_ivy ivy and shrubs not black; two-sided foliage lit on both faces; no shiny leaves in the shade
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -20,250,330
Тогда-вид 4b_bistro_ivy_shade under the awning: leaves in shade stay matte (specular occlusion), not black
